# Ryn wakes up captive in the Monastery (Milestone 20b, escape start).
# Plays once, the first time the Monastery loads on Ryn's game.

wait 0.6
emote player ...
narrate Incense, long gone cold. Somewhere above, a gong trembles with no one striking it.
face player left
wait 0.4
face player right
wait 0.4
face player down
say Ryn: The training halls... I'd know these floors blindfolded. But the masters' voices are all wrong now.
say Ryn: They left my hands free. Careless. Breathe in, breathe out - then find a way out.
narrate From deeper in the halls comes a muffled voice, calling for help.
